From: Stained Glass OS contributors
Subject: mmc, eventvwr, resmon, cleanmgr: the administrative tools' launchers carry icons

They hand off to the shell's consoles but had no icon: the Start menu's
Computer Management, Device Manager, Disk Cleanup and Event Viewer, and every
.msc file (its icon is mmc.exe's), showed the generic program icon. The icons
are the consoles' own art (sg-shell src/mmc/gen-icons.py: COMPUTER, EVENTS,
SCAN, DISK), 16 to 64 pixels, PNG-compressed, written into each .rc as the
.ico file's bytes so the patch stays text.

--- a/programs/mmc/Makefile.in
+++ b/programs/mmc/Makefile.in
@@ -5,4 +5,5 @@
 EXTRADLLFLAGS = -mwindows -municode
 
 SOURCES = \
-	handoff.c
+	handoff.c \
+	mmc.rc
--- /dev/null
+++ b/programs/mmc/mmc.rc
@@ -0,0 +1,164 @@
